{{Term/Store|Roasted Hearty Durian|Roasted Hearty Durians|Series, BotW|plural}} are [[Item]]s in {{BotW}}.<ref name="Inventory">{{Cite|{{Big|Roasted Hearty Durian}}<br/>This hearty durian was roasted whole inside its hard shell. Unfortunately, roasting it did nothing to remove its distinct odor. Eat it to recover a lot of hearts.|Inventory|BotW}}</ref>

==Location and Uses==
Roasted Hearty Durians are a type of [[Roasted Food]], resulting from [[Hearty Durian]]s that have made contact with [[Fire]] or a [[Scorching Climate]].<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 295}}</ref> The roasting process does nothing to diminish the harsh odor of Hearty Durians, as it still retains its signature smell.<ref name="Inventory"/> [[Link]] can restore four and a half [[Heart]]s to his [[Life Gauge]] by eating a Roasted Hearty Durian.

